  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0014_03405827cdef.png\" /> <br/><br/>Opening upward parabola,  <math><mn>2</mn></math>  lies between the roots.<br/><br/> <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
